#Docker & #Kubernetes Interview Preparation – 1 to 2 Years

Containers are mandatory skills for modern DevOps roles.

Here are Docker & Kubernetes interview questions 👇

Docker

• What is Docker and why do we use it?
• Difference between Docker image and container?
• What is a Dockerfile?
• What is Docker Compose?
Difference between CMD and ENTRYPOINT?
• What is a Docker volume?
• What is Docker networking?
• What is a multi-stage Docker build?

Kubernetes

• Why do we use Kubernetes?
• What is a Pod?
• Difference between Pod and Container?
• What is a Deployment?
• What is a Service in Kubernetes?
• Types of Kubernetes services?
• What is a Namespace?
• What is ConfigMap?
• What is a Secret?
• What is ReplicaSet?
• What is rolling update?
• What is liveness and readiness probe?
• What is kubectl?
• How do you troubleshoot a failing pod?
• What Kubernetes issues have you faced in your project?
